   1: # joeysvault-site
   2:
   3: Source of truth for the public sites:
   4:
   5: - `www.joeysvault.app` — landing page (`src/pages/www.html`)
   6: - `projects.joeysvault.app` — project list with the overview video (`src/pages/projects.html`)
   7:
   8: Both are served by one Cloudflare Worker (`src/index.js`). Media is in `public/` and is served with
   9: HTTP range support so video seeks correctly. `scripts/media-sizes.mjs` runs at deploy time and records
  10: file sizes for that.
  11:
  12: `joeysvault.app` (bare domain) redirects to `www`. `upload.` and `vllm.` belong to the separate `flue-manager`
  13: Worker and are not in this repository.
  14:
  15: ## Publishing
  16:
  17: `main` is production. Cloudflare Workers Builds deploys every push to `main`; each deploy is a
  18: versioned release that can be rolled back from the Cloudflare dashboard (Workers & Pages → joeysvault-site →
  19: Deployments). Do not run `wrangler deploy` by hand against this Worker.
  20:
  21: ## Changing the overview video
  22:
  23: Replace `public/energy-overview.mp4` and `public/energy-overview.jpg`, bump the `?v=` on the two URLs in
  24: `src/pages/projects.html`, and push. Files must be under 25 MiB each.
  25:
  26: No credentials belong in this repository.

